# 中频词汇 List06
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List06核心词汇

{{craft}}{/krɑːft/}{工艺；手艺；精心制作}{Each piece of jewelry is crafted by hand.}}
{{crash}}{/kræʃ/}{碰撞；崩溃}{The stock market crash affected millions of investors.}}
{{create}}{/kriˈeɪt/}{创造；创建}{The artist created a stunning mural on the wall.}}
{{credit}}{/ˈkredɪt/}{信用；功劳}{She deserves credit for the success of the campaign.}}
{{crew}}{/kruː/}{全体船员；工作人员}{The film crew worked tirelessly to finish the shoot.}}
{{crime}}{/kraɪm/}{犯罪；罪行}{The city has seen a rise in violent crime.}}
{{crisis}}{/ˈkraɪsɪs/}{危机；紧要关头}{The economic crisis led to widespread unemployment.}}
{{criterion}}{/kraɪˈtɪəriən/}{标准；准则}{The main criterion for selection is academic performance.}}
{{critical}}{/ˈkrɪtɪkl/}{批评的；关键的}{Critical thinking is essential for academic success.}}
{{crucial}}{/ˈkruːʃl/}{至关重要的}{Timing is crucial in the stock market.}}
{{cultivate}}{/ˈkʌltɪveɪt/}{培养；耕种}{Schools should cultivate creativity in students.}}
{{curiosity}}{/ˌkjʊəriˈɒsəti/}{好奇心；求知欲}{Children have a natural curiosity about the world.}}
{{currency}}{/ˈkʌrənsi/}{货币；通用}{The euro is the official currency of many European countries.}}
{{curriculum}}{/kəˈrɪkjələm/}{课程；课程表}{The school revised its curriculum to include coding.}}
{{custom}}{/ˈkʌstəm/}{习惯；风俗；海关}{It is a local custom to remove shoes before entering a home.}}
{{debate}}{/dɪˈbeɪt/}{辩论；讨论}{The debate over climate change policy continues.}}
{{decade}}{/ˈdekeɪd/}{十年}{Technology has advanced significantly over the past decade.}}
{{decline}}{/dɪˈklaɪn/}{下降；拒绝}{The population of the species has declined dramatically.}}
{{dedicate}}{/ˈdedɪkeɪt/}{致力于；奉献}{She dedicated her life to helping the poor.}}
{{defeat}}{/dɪˈfiːt/}{击败；失败}{The team suffered a surprising defeat in the semifinals.}}
{{defend}}{/dɪˈfend/}{防御；辩护}{The lawyer defended his client vigorously.}}
{{define}}{/dɪˈfaɪn/}{定义；限定}{How do you define success in your life?}}
{{deliberate}}{/dɪˈlɪbərət/}{故意的；深思熟虑的}{The decision was a deliberate attempt to undermine trust.}}
{{delicate}}{/ˈdelɪkət/}{精致的；微妙的}{The negotiations require a delicate approach.}}
{{deliver}}{/dɪˈlɪvər/}{交付；发表}{The company promises to deliver within three days.}}
{{demand}}{/dɪˈmɑːnd/}{要求；需求}{There is a growing demand for renewable energy.}}
{{democracy}}{/dɪˈmɒkrəsi/}{民主；民主政治}{Democracy requires active participation from citizens.}}
{{demonstrate}}{/ˈdemənstreɪt/}{证明；演示}{The experiment demonstrates the effects of gravity.}}
{{deny}}{/dɪˈnaɪ/}{否认；拒绝}{He denied any involvement in the scandal.}}
{{depict}}{/dɪˈpɪkt/}{描绘；描述}{The painting depicts a beautiful landscape.}}
